# CtrlX Relay configuration templates
#
# Copy exactly one template to its active filename in this directory:
#   .env.local        highest priority, local developer overrides
#   .env.production   production or isolated staging deployment
#   .env.development  local development
#   .env.test         automated tests
#
# CtrlX reads the first existing file in that order and does not merge lower
# priority files. Never commit an active .env.* file or private key.
